WEBVTT

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:21.750
I've missed you, Kyohei-sama!

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:27.800
I'd given up on ever overcoming the barrier 
separating the Hyuga and Kuga.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:28.880
But...

00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:34.970
Kou-chan and Kirio are doing as they like, 
outside the village.

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:39.600
No need for me to be the one good girl.

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:41.600
Who's this?

00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:43.230
Hyuga

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:45.560
Mahiru-neesama?

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:31.060
This is our first in-person meeting.

00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:34.090
Hello, Karahari Kuuko-san.

00:02:34.360 --> 00:02:37.510
I didn't expect you to contact us.

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:39.720
I figured this way would best

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:42.120
avoid unnecessary trouble.

00:02:43.690 --> 00:02:49.830
And... I know you well, Kuga Aki-kun.

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:51.920
I can't even remember

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:55.520
the last time someone called me by that name.

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:58.540
I am Hirashiro Takeshi.

00:02:59.180 --> 00:03:01.950
The first Diet member from Karakami Village.

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:06.950
<b>Episode 10</b>

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:06.950
<b>The Princess Arrives</b>

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:08.700
Hyuga

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:11.040
Mahiru-neesama!

00:03:11.490 --> 00:03:15.290
Hey, Kyohei-sama, let's go somewhere.

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:20.130
Get away from Kyohei!

00:03:21.020 --> 00:03:22.670
For a second,

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:25.260
I thought I heard the whining of 
a little girl with a brother complex,

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:26.560
but I guess it was my imagination.

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:30.560
<i>Stay calm... Stay calm...</i>

00:03:34.470 --> 00:03:35.440
Hey, Mahiru—

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:36.190
Shut up.

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:37.660
Utao-chan!

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:38.860
What are you doing?

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:40.280
She's just a kid.

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:43.760
This doesn't concern you. Get lost.

00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:45.140
It does!

00:03:45.140 --> 00:03:46.670
Hibino-san...

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:48.540
My dad's from Karakami Village.

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:51.200
Oh, yeah?

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:53.960
Then you really should shut up.

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:57.210
You're just some peasant.

00:03:58.390 --> 00:04:01.790
Th-This isn't Karakami Village!

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:03.100
We're all equals...

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:04.760
You can't say that!

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:06.140
Bitch...

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:07.790
Mahiru, that's enough!

00:04:07.790 --> 00:04:09.090
Kyohei-sama?

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:11.060
Don't hurt Hibino-san.

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:12.880
Kyohei-sama?

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:14.550
What is this?

00:04:14.550 --> 00:04:16.190
Who is she?

00:04:17.310 --> 00:04:18.190
Kou!

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:23.250
I won't ask how or why you came to be here.

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:25.160
I've only one thing to say.

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:27.400
Return to the village immediately.

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:33.180
Everyone's ganging up on me...

00:04:33.180 --> 00:04:36.720
Don't any of you know how I feel?

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:40.950
Jerks!

00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:44.260
Hibino-san?

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:51.560
Stop it, Mahiru.

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:54.760
Things were finally calming down.

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:57.410
Don't make my job harder.

00:04:57.410 --> 00:04:58.830
Shut up...

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:08.700
You'd better stop, or I'm going to get mad.

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:12.330
Go ahead...

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:21.210
I said that's enough!

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:22.960
Got you!

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:27.470
M-Magatsuhi?

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:33.720
It's futile.

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:36.300
Within Magatsuhi's barrier,

00:05:36.300 --> 00:05:40.480
Kamu no Chi is completely under my control.

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:44.230
Your thoughts can't reach Uwazutsu.

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:48.180
What shall I do?

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:51.620
Maybe I'll just crush it!

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:54.870
What? Are they recording a TV show?

00:05:55.460 --> 00:05:57.370
I think I see some big papier-mâché puppets.

00:05:58.010 --> 00:05:59.400
<i>Onlookers...</i>

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:00.880
Would you just stop, Mahiru?

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:02.500
That's enough.

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:05.420
Don't tell me what to do.

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:06.760
You're just an Utsuwashi.

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:11.740
And as an Utsuwashi, I'm telling you 
not to make my job more difficult!

00:06:11.740 --> 00:06:13.430
Or I won't fix Magatsuhi anymore.

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:15.180
That's fine.

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:17.570
My Magatsuhi is invincible.

00:06:17.570 --> 00:06:20.060
No one can hurt it.

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:22.650
Sure about that?

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:25.030
I won't maintain it, either...

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:28.130
Kakashi are made of wood.

00:06:28.130 --> 00:06:30.160
Their parts wear out fast.

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:33.660
And you need to regularly 
replace the Kamu no Chi.

00:06:34.250 --> 00:06:38.540
If you're saying I don't have to do that anymore...

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:40.400
Shut up! Shut up!

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:43.460
What matters is that my Magatsuhi is the strongest!

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:46.630
So no one can disobey or ignore me!

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:50.200
What's that?

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:51.900
It's moving really fast!

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:54.930
Like that will do anything.

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:57.310
Great!

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:58.310
One more!

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:02.190
Don't get cocky!

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:04.060
Kukuri!

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:06.670
The barrier!

00:07:07.220 --> 00:07:10.250
Why, you... Little brat!

00:07:16.730 --> 00:07:20.160
Once the barrier falls, you're mine.

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:25.330
I hate you all!

00:07:27.450 --> 00:07:28.470
A gas explosion?

00:07:28.470 --> 00:07:30.050
Call the cops!

00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:37.670
Don't you find it so primitive, 
for the Kuga and Hyuga to fight?

00:07:38.050 --> 00:07:40.520
I believe that Karakami Village's treasures

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:44.440
can be used to benefit the people.

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:46.790
By treasures, you mean the kakashi?

00:07:46.790 --> 00:07:51.940
Yeah, when I investigated your village, 
I found that it's connected to them.

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:54.410
And to him, as well.

00:07:55.820 --> 00:07:59.470
Kuuko-san, you really have learned too much.

00:08:00.400 --> 00:08:02.960
So I thought we should meet face to face.

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:04.690
Crafty geezer...

00:08:04.690 --> 00:08:07.040
The elders wouldn't like that, though.

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:10.150
No matter their arrogance,

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:12.610
that village is a relic of the past.

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:16.460
It should adjust its way of life to the times.

00:08:16.460 --> 00:08:19.500
And the elders must be eliminated,

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:20.060
right?

00:08:21.210 --> 00:08:24.650
You're the one who freed me from that prison...

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:26.730
It wasn't easy.

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:29.010
But then you vanished.

00:08:29.010 --> 00:08:32.760
I was quite surprised when 
I learned you ended up in Tokyo.

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:35.980
You thought I'd head to the shrine 
and just start killing?

00:08:36.780 --> 00:08:40.540
Is Kuga Kyohei that important to you?

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:44.050
I've wasted my time.

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:45.870
Wait!

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:49.580
I haven't heard your answer.

00:08:49.580 --> 00:08:52.130
Will you work with me?

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:54.530
I...

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:01.720
Goddamn it...

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:03.710
I hate them all!

00:09:03.710 --> 00:09:06.350
Kou! Utao! Moyako and Kirio!

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:09.110
And that chick with the big melons!

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:11.690
What's going on? Who is she to Kyohei-sama?!

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:15.320
Mahiru-sama, calm down...

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:16.810
Don't peek, pervert.

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:20.330
Everyone is pissing me off!

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:22.370
What is this?

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:25.980
Aki?

00:09:26.630 --> 00:09:27.960
Hirashiro,

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:30.600
I came because you said there was 
something important to discuss.

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:32.590
What's going on?

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:35.600
You never said you were working with Aki.

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:38.250
Mahiru-sama, this is...

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:38.840
Don't look!

00:09:40.050 --> 00:09:40.960
What?

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:43.040
So that's how it is...

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:46.280
I wasn't the only one you were soliciting.

00:09:46.280 --> 00:09:48.650
Hirashiro, what are you thinking?

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:51.440
I'm thinking about Karakami Village's future.

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:55.040
Depending on what you're planning, 
I may have to kill you...

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:56.400
Lackey!

00:09:56.810 --> 00:10:00.280
You're all grown up, Mahiru.

00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:06.270
That's Mahiru-sama. I'm your better.

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:08.080
You're just a loser.

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:09.460
A loser?

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:11.390
That's right.

00:10:11.390 --> 00:10:12.290
Ever since back then...

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:17.120
When you couldn't do anything...

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:20.680
You've been nothing but a loser to me.

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:23.890
You really have grown up!

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:26.270
Huh?

00:10:29.050 --> 00:10:30.440
Nice dodge.

00:10:30.910 --> 00:10:34.790
I should make it clear who's the better here.

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:36.780
I'll show you who's on top!

00:10:38.470 --> 00:10:39.570
The barrier?

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:50.730
Too bad...

00:10:50.730 --> 00:10:52.940
Just a second too slow.

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:04.180
Loser. Know your place.

00:11:04.180 --> 00:11:06.330
Maybe I'll kill you.

00:11:06.330 --> 00:11:09.690
But then Kyohei-sama would be sad, wouldn't he?

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:12.270
Kyohei...

00:11:12.700 --> 00:11:14.500
You lucked out, Aki.

00:11:14.500 --> 00:11:18.150
Kyohei-sama just saved your life.

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:19.530
Stupid kid!

00:11:24.730 --> 00:11:26.950
Nice toy you've got here, four-eyes.

00:11:46.960 --> 00:11:50.340
Everyone's kind of glum...

00:11:50.340 --> 00:11:51.890
Did something happen?

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:54.560
No, nothing.

00:12:00.720 --> 00:12:02.460
<i>She's a damned typhoon.</i>

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:04.620
<i>She just sweeps in and wrecks everything!</i>

00:12:05.060 --> 00:12:08.000
<i>Why is Mahiru-neesama here?</i>

00:12:10.430 --> 00:12:12.080
<i><b>I'm</b> your big sister.</i>

00:12:13.190 --> 00:12:14.130
<i>What?</i>

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:17.960
<i>You were only born a few seconds before me!</i>

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:20.840
<i>It matters!</i>

00:12:21.070 --> 00:12:23.930
<i>Call me your "onee-chan"!</i>

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:25.410
<i>Shut up!</i>

00:12:25.410 --> 00:12:28.750
<i>If you want to be my big sister, act like it!</i>

00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:31.230
<i>Th-Then what about Mahiru-chan?</i>

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:32.810
<i>Mahiru-neesama is...</i>

00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:36.270
<b>Remembering...</b>

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:46.030
Um, Utao-chan?

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:48.880
That's your sixth bowl.

00:12:48.880 --> 00:12:49.950
You still want more?

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:51.080
You'll get fat.

00:12:59.260 --> 00:13:01.610
Hey, wait long?

00:13:01.610 --> 00:13:03.000
No.

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:04.640
Thanks...

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:10.960
You could've asked back there, but you gave me 
a chance to talk about it later.

00:13:10.960 --> 00:13:15.730
Well, you wouldn't have wanted to 
discuss it in front of the girls and the kid.

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:18.230
You're showing me pity?

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:20.160
And to be honest,

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:23.470
I wasn't sure it was something they should hear.

00:13:23.470 --> 00:13:26.010
You always worry about that stuff...

00:13:26.010 --> 00:13:29.740
But you're going to explain it to me,

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:32.750
the connection between you and Mahiru.

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:36.750
Are you awake?

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:40.140
It's no good.

00:13:40.140 --> 00:13:42.510
I gave you a special shot

00:13:42.510 --> 00:13:45.630
that keeps you from talking to your kakashi.

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:51.140
Even if you could, 
Kuramitsuha is in Magatsuhi's barrier.

00:13:51.140 --> 00:13:56.180
I didn't expect that he was the one who freed you.

00:13:56.180 --> 00:13:59.090
Not that it matters to me.

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:03.070
It doesn't matter that Hirashiro contacted you.

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:05.530
You don't matter at all.

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:08.780
I came here to meet Kyohei-sama.

00:14:09.350 --> 00:14:10.660
Kyohei, huh?

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:12.340
Ultimately,

00:14:12.340 --> 00:14:16.410
you can't do anything without relying on him.

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:19.990
Ever since then...

00:14:20.690 --> 00:14:24.380
Seven years ago... 
No, I suppose it would be eight...

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:27.880
That's when we found that thing.

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:30.640
<i>Aki, over there!</i>

00:14:32.030 --> 00:14:33.560
<i>It's Magatsuhi!</i>

00:14:34.030 --> 00:14:35.500
Who's that?

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:38.010
Mahiru-chan, of the Hyuga?

00:14:38.010 --> 00:14:40.280
The one who just had her inheritance ceremony.

00:14:40.280 --> 00:14:41.310
What's she doing down there?

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:46.170
She was probably so happy to get a kakashi 
that she went flying around,

00:14:46.170 --> 00:14:48.070
and she crashed.

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:49.940
Is she okay?

00:14:49.940 --> 00:14:53.870
Hey, you! Wake up... Wake up now!

00:14:56.980 --> 00:14:58.080
Freaking Hyuga.

00:14:58.080 --> 00:14:59.960
You try to do anything nice for them...

00:15:00.490 --> 00:15:01.320
Kuga?

00:15:03.240 --> 00:15:05.590
You have guts, kid. I'll kill you!

00:15:11.790 --> 00:15:13.990
I guess you're a Hyuga princess, after all.

00:15:13.990 --> 00:15:17.000
You aren't sobbing on me.

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:20.980
Listen! If you're going to fight, fight to kill.

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:21.780
Hey.

00:15:21.780 --> 00:15:23.100
What?

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:24.190
Hey!

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:25.390
Shut up!

00:15:25.390 --> 00:15:27.650
Her kakashi and I are about to...

00:15:26.180 --> 00:15:27.650
What's that?

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:30.240
What?

00:15:30.830 --> 00:15:32.780
It feels really nasty.

00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:36.550
She feels it, too.

00:15:36.550 --> 00:15:39.470
I guess that explains why they made her 
a Seki, despite her age.

00:15:40.880 --> 00:15:41.670
What do we do?

00:15:42.400 --> 00:15:45.670
Don't you want to see what's in it?

00:15:48.240 --> 00:15:50.170
Yeah, I do...

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:55.740
Mahiru-chan, we're leaving, so go home.

00:15:55.740 --> 00:15:58.700
From now on, practice near the village.

00:16:08.800 --> 00:16:10.690
Hey, she's following us.

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:12.670
Leave her be.

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:16.970
Glowing moss?

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:18.200
Hey, over there!

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:20.330
A kakashi?

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:21.710
I think so.

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:25.190
But I've never heard of one with four legs.

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:28.210
It doesn't belong to the Hyuga or the Kuga.

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:31.760
Can you hear it?

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:32.780
Yeah.

00:16:32.780 --> 00:16:34.640
It's faint, but there's a presence.

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:35.900
Which means...

00:16:35.900 --> 00:16:39.770
If we give it a Seki, it'll move.

00:16:39.770 --> 00:16:42.100
We should tell the adults.

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:44.320
Tell them? Why?

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:45.650
Why?

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:51.530
Hey, Kyohei, want to keep this kakashi as our secret?

00:16:52.540 --> 00:16:53.530
Aki?

00:16:55.600 --> 00:16:56.530
Watch out!

00:16:58.090 --> 00:16:59.370
Shut up, kid!

00:17:00.710 --> 00:17:01.750
Aki!

00:17:02.110 --> 00:17:05.210
Devour... I will devour...

00:17:04.210 --> 00:17:05.210
It's got me.

00:17:07.130 --> 00:17:09.340
A voice? Its voice?

00:17:09.770 --> 00:17:12.200
The memories in your heart...

00:17:12.200 --> 00:17:17.890
A dark whirlpool of hatred and obsession...

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:19.620
I'll devour...

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:21.930
All of it!

00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:25.440
Aki!

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:31.480
Crap!

00:17:36.930 --> 00:17:38.160
Run!

00:17:50.220 --> 00:17:52.160
Are you guys okay?

00:17:54.190 --> 00:17:55.880
What was that?

00:17:57.030 --> 00:17:58.420
I dunno.

00:17:58.420 --> 00:18:00.760
But I think it followed us.

00:18:05.760 --> 00:18:09.000
Mahiru-chan, get Magatsuhi.

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:11.080
I can't beat it alone!

00:18:11.080 --> 00:18:12.480
You, too, Aki!

00:18:13.490 --> 00:18:14.990
Guess I have to.

00:18:14.990 --> 00:18:17.360
We'll hit it from three directions! Split up!

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:23.490
Take this!

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:30.490
Here I go! You two, dodge!

00:18:34.140 --> 00:18:35.010
How was that!?

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:49.420
Magatsuhi's barrier...

00:18:50.170 --> 00:18:51.300
I did it...

00:18:51.300 --> 00:18:55.570
Now to control the Kamu no Chi, like in 
the manual I read yesterday...

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:05.720
Mahiru-chan, what are you doing?

00:19:05.720 --> 00:19:07.160
It's after you!

00:19:07.430 --> 00:19:08.120
Damn it...

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:14.290
Are you okay?

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:15.880
Don't stop, Kyohei!

00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:18.800
Crap!

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:20.720
This time, you're mine!

00:19:21.680 --> 00:19:23.680
You did it... You're under it!

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:25.140
Take this!

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:26.140
Did he get it?

00:19:26.860 --> 00:19:27.640
Not deep enough.

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:38.860
Kuramitsuha...

00:19:38.860 --> 00:19:41.100
Move... Move, damn it!

00:19:59.590 --> 00:20:01.470
W- we did it...

00:20:04.830 --> 00:20:06.220
Kuramitsuha...

00:20:06.910 --> 00:20:08.930
Aki, you okay?

00:20:08.930 --> 00:20:11.610
Yeah... How's the kid?

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:15.110
She isn't hurt, but she's really scared.

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:16.740
I bet she is.

00:20:17.200 --> 00:20:19.700
That thing eats your mind.

00:20:20.300 --> 00:20:23.030
I think doing that replaces having a Seki.

00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:25.320
That's how it could move without one.

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:27.660
I've never heard of a kakashi like that.

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:31.380
Me, neither! But it was there...

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:54.260
Don't pull me, Kyohei...

00:20:55.290 --> 00:20:56.770
It hurts.

00:20:56.770 --> 00:20:58.310
You're going to tear off my arm!

00:20:58.830 --> 00:21:00.780
Enough! Leave me!

00:21:00.780 --> 00:21:02.280
Shut up, already!

00:21:04.070 --> 00:21:06.320
Damn... Damn it!

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:15.210
It's over...

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:18.210
Kukuri...

00:21:28.370 --> 00:21:31.180
That was as far as my sanity could reach.

00:21:32.890 --> 00:21:36.040
Next thing I knew, the adults were there,

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:40.450
and the monster kakashi was destroyed.

00:21:42.150 --> 00:21:43.570
Did you do it?

00:21:45.280 --> 00:21:50.450
Anyway, ever since then, my mind's been broken.

00:21:51.490 --> 00:21:55.210
If it hadn't been for Kyohei-sama back then,

00:21:55.630 --> 00:21:58.710
all of us would have died...

00:21:59.440 --> 00:22:03.850
If he hadn't opened Kukuri's left hand.

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:46.480
<b>Kamisama 
Dolls</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:46.480
<b>Corner</b>

00:23:35.470 --> 00:23:38.870
So popular, it's nearly out of control... 
It's Kamisama Dolls Corner!

00:23:38.710 --> 00:23:39.850
<b>Who Mahiru-chan 
really is!!</b>

00:23:38.710 --> 00:23:39.850
<b>Don't be 
fooled!!</b>

00:23:38.870 --> 00:23:40.510
Today, we'll discuss Mahiru-chan. Let's go!

00:23:40.510 --> 00:23:41.850
She's a cute, yet elegant princess.

00:23:41.850 --> 00:23:42.900
But she's actually really mean!

00:23:42.900 --> 00:23:44.560
You can see her real self in these pictures.

00:23:44.560 --> 00:23:45.360
Be careful, Kyohei!

00:23:45.360 --> 00:23:46.480
Be careful, everyone!

00:23:46.480 --> 00:23:47.960
Now, then... Next time: Hibino Kidnapped.

00:23:46.480 --> 00:23:49.950
<b>Next Episode: 
Hibino Kidnapped</b>

00:23:47.960 --> 00:23:49.950
If you don't watch, things will go out of control!

